B. delta-Q content (linearized, clock background Q0):
  unit-norm O(eps): dA0 = h00/2  (no h0i, no a^i -> pure h00)
  delta Q at O(eps)  = Q0*h00/2 + chi_t
  delta Q at O(eps^2)= aL*chi_z + chi_t*h00/2
  transverse fields (aT,h0T) in dQ O(eps): False  O(eps^2): False
  -> -F_QQ (dQ)^2 quadratic action contains NO transverse aether/metric;
     it cannot shift or cancel alpha_1's transverse response. Q0-free
     piece of (dQ^(1))^2 = chi_t^2 -> (w.q)^2 chi^2 (convective), w_par-only.

C. eta_K = (K_B J_Y + 2)/(J_Y + 1):
